flowchart TD
    %% Verification Gate — implementation authority:
    %% handlers/lifecycle.py, harness/, providers.py, and harness-verify/SKILL.md
    %% Palette: documents/diagrams/source/_shared/palette.md

    START(["All T-NNN tasks claimed complete"]):::terminal
    START --> SESSION["skill-enter --skill harness-verify --feature &lt;slug&gt;<br/>writes status.md to Verifying<br/>loads bounded verification context pack"]:::core

    SESSION --> VERIFY["Run cli.py verify --feature &lt;slug&gt; --skill harness-verify<br/>or add --dry-run to inspect without executing gates"]:::core
    VERIFY --> PHASE["1. check_readiness for Verify<br/>prerequisites present · valid state transition<br/>all tasks complete with evidence"]:::gate
    PHASE --> ARTIFACT["2. artifact-check --trace<br/>required headings · AC-to-task linkage<br/>no orphan or unmapped ACs"]:::gate
    ARTIFACT --> GATES["3. Execute adopter-confirmed gates<br/>argv-safe by default · timeout<br/>on_fail = block / warn / continue"]:::gate
    GATES --> PROVIDER["4. Run selected review provider<br/>none or optional unavailable = deferred<br/>required unavailable or command failure = failed"]:::external

    PROVIDER --> RESULT{details.verified?}:::decision
    RESULT -->|No| MODE{verification.mode}:::decision
    MODE -->|advisory| DEFER["CLI status = deferred (exit 0)<br/>findings and warnings reported<br/>details.verified = false"]:::decision
    MODE -->|blocking| FAIL["CLI status = failed (exit 1)<br/>required failures returned as errors"]:::fail
    DEFER --> REOPEN
    FAIL --> REOPEN["Reopen affected tasks or return to<br/>/spec-implement · /spec-plan · /spec-requirements"]:::fail

    RESULT -->|Yes| AUDIT["Skill-owned verification review<br/>fresh evidence · clean state · dropped behavior<br/>AC-to-proof · design conformance · security"]:::memory
    AUDIT --> PROD{High/Critical production risk?}:::decision
    PROD -->|Yes| READY["Apply production-readiness checklist<br/>operations · rollback · data · performance"]:::optional
    PROD -->|No| FALLOW
    READY --> FALLOW{Useful fallow cleanup?}:::decision
    FALLOW -->|Yes| CLEANUP["Clean only task-touched files<br/>preserve behavior · rerun verify"]:::optional
    CLEANUP --> VERIFY
    FALLOW -->|No| REVIEW

    REVIEW["Write artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/review.md<br/>verdict (# and ## Decision) · findings<br/>gate outcomes · traceability · security"]:::memory
    REVIEW --> VERDICT{Review verdict}:::decision
    VERDICT -->|Fail| REOPEN
    VERDICT -->|Pass or Pass with Debt| SYNC["Write ## Post-Ship Sync in session-extracts.md<br/>mandatory before skill-exit to Done"]:::memory
    SYNC --> CLOSE["skill-exit --skill harness-verify --handoff context-memory<br/>updates status.md to Done"]:::gate
    CLOSE --> DONE(["Done<br/>harness-verify is sole authority"]):::terminal

    classDef terminal fill:#111827,stroke:#111827,color:#fff
    classDef core fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef gate fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#16a34a,color:#166534
    classDef decision fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#78350f
    classDef optional fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#475569,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef external fill:#f0f9ff,stroke:#0ea5e9,color:#0c4a6e,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef memory fill:#faf5ff,stroke:#a855f7,color:#4c1d95
    classDef fail fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#ef4444,color:#7f1d1d

    class START,DONE terminal
    class SESSION,VERIFY core
    class PHASE,ARTIFACT,GATES,CLOSE gate
    class RESULT,MODE,PROD,FALLOW,VERDICT,DEFER decision
    class READY,CLEANUP optional
    class PROVIDER external
    class AUDIT,REVIEW,SYNC memory
    class FAIL,REOPEN fail
